//! Deliberately small source-to-G1 compiler bootstrap.
//!
//! This is a scalar, monomorphic-nominal, structural-reference, and closed
//! terminal/one-shot-handler vertical slice with straight-line local loans, not
//! a fallback to the interpreter: every source form outside the documented
//! subset is rejected before typed Core is constructed.

